    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack &amp; Slash your way through a world full of punks, metal heads, droogs, skinheads and other interesting types in this hand-drawn 2D adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236350/extras/99a435d113738dda4d71fa3be29ab24b.poster.avif?t=1752946746\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236350/extras/99a435d113738dda4d71fa3be29ab24b.webm?t=1752946746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236350/extras/99a435d113738dda4d71fa3be29ab24b.mp4?t=1752946746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a Gritty, Non-linear, Hand-Drawn World in a classic 2D style.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the tattered streets of Orangeside, a city full of subcultures, hidden secrets, and unexpected challenges at every turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore seven illustrative levels with grandiose parallax for an impression of depth, from the humble suburbs, to the boundaries beyond Orangeside.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight controls so you can bash your way through even the most formidable foe.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield your Les Paul guitar in straightforward, skill-based bloody combat. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through bosses and various subcultures. You'll engage with droogs, punks, metal heads, and more as you journey through Orangeside.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain new tools such as the semi-lethal firearm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character from body type, voice, to hair, and clothing styles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompany your journey with a rock-centric soundtrack featuring punk, metal, and darkwave, heightening the intensity of every encounter composed by the developer.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack &amp; Slash your way through a world full of punks, metal heads, droogs, skinheads and other interesting types in this hand-drawn 2D adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236350/extras/99a435d113738dda4d71fa3be29ab24b.poster.avif?t=1752946746\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236350/extras/99a435d113738dda4d71fa3be29ab24b.webm?t=1752946746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236350/extras/99a435d113738dda4d71fa3be29ab24b.mp4?t=1752946746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a Gritty, Non-linear, Hand-Drawn World in a classic 2D style.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the tattered streets of Orangeside, a city full of subcultures, hidden secrets, and unexpected challenges at every turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore seven illustrative levels with grandiose parallax for an impression of depth, from the humble suburbs, to the boundaries beyond Orangeside.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight controls so you can bash your way through even the most formidable foe.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield your Les Paul guitar in straightforward, skill-based bloody combat. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through bosses and various subcultures. You'll engage with droogs, punks, metal heads, and more as you journey through Orangeside.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain new tools such as the semi-lethal firearm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character from body type, voice, to hair, and clothing styles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompany your journey with a rock-centric soundtrack featuring punk, metal, and darkwave, heightening the intensity of every encounter composed by the developer.</p></li></ul>",
